1
00:00:01,200 --> 00:00:03,400
Cześć! Dzień dobry!

2
00:00:03,790 --> 00:00:08,700
I am standing inside the
place where Wrocław started,

3
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:12,490
Ostrów Tumski, the Cathedral Island.

4
00:00:13,510 --> 00:00:17,200
In between all those amazing
churches and monasteries

5
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:21,850
and beautiful structures, there
is a piece of green heaven.

6
00:00:22,350 --> 00:00:27,770
I am referring to the Botanical
Gardens of Wrocław, just behind me.

7
00:00:27,770 --> 00:00:31,200
This is part of the University of Wrocław.

8
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,790
I recommend coming here to enjoy the

9
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:38,530
beautiful trees, flowers and plantation.

10
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:42,530
Walk in all those nice pathways

11
00:00:42,530 --> 00:00:45,700
in between those gardens and enjoy a big lake

12
00:00:45,700 --> 00:00:49,800
with a wonderful bridge and a fountain.

13
00:00:49,800 --> 00:00:54,630
It's a very romantic place, so I
really recommend couples to come

14
00:00:54,630 --> 00:00:57,000
and stroll in this garden.

15
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,330
Also, I would like to recommend
visiting, just before or after,

16
00:01:01,330 --> 00:01:04,700
the Jadwigi café, which is inside a monastery

17
00:01:04,700 --> 00:01:08,350
adjacent to the Botanical Garden

18
00:01:08,350 --> 00:01:12,400
and has a little botanical garden by itself.

19
00:01:12,400 --> 00:01:14,200
This is a must-visit.

20
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:17,000
See you in our next video.

21
00:01:17,100 --> 00:01:18,900
Do widzenia!
